{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2023-03-06 15:00:00', 'title': 'PRATT & WHITNEY AWARDED F135 PRODUCTION CONTRACT FOR LOTS 15-17', 'text': 'EAST HARTFORD, CONN. , MARCH 6, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0PRATT & WHITNEY, A RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: RTX) BUSINESS, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN AWARDED A $5.2 BILLION CONTRACT TO SUPPORT PRODUCTION OF THE 15TH AND 16TH LOTS OF F135 ENGINES, WITH AN OPTION TO AWARD A 17TH LOT, POWERING ALL THREE VARIANTS OF THE F-35 LIGHTNING II FIGHTER AIRCRAFT.'}